  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Shelter Support for IDPs Affected by the Floods</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">From 17 to 22 January 2023, Kosovo (as per UNSC Res.1244 (1999)) experienced severe flooding, which had a devastating impact. In most places, both urban and rural zones were affected by a rapid increase of water levels in a short period of time, which resulted in significant damage. This 6-month project aims to respond to the needs of the displaced people that have been affected by heavy rains and devastating. This project contributes to strengthening the resilience of the affected people, through the provision of accommodation, shelter and recovery support for the most vulnerable households.</narrative>
  </description>
